      "customData": {
        "kind": "canvas",
        "title": "Shared credits, then permitted metered usage",
        "description": "Assigned Business and Enterprise licenses fund a shared included pool, not user wallets; after consumption exhausts it, permitted metered usage requires paid-usage policy and applicable enforced budgets. Copilot access takes the metered path from first use, with no included pool."
